# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Test Coverage
coverage/

# Test Results (kecuali template)
testsprite_tests/
!testsprite_tests/README.md
!testsprite_tests/templates/

# Logs
*.log
dev_server.log
dev_output.log

